From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:34:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Animate Analysis durations and charts from zero

Add reusable rememberAnimatedDuration/rememberAnimatedFraction helpers backed
by Animatable. The weekday duration table counts its labels up and grows its
progress bars with a 50 ms stagger; the summary counters, top-app durations
and Canvas bar charts rise from zero. The animation is snapped to its final
value immediately when the new Animate statistics setting is off.
